<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Spine-Tech.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Spine-Tech.</headline>
<dateline>SAN FRANCISCO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co analyst Jeffrey Barnes on Wednesday raised his earnings estimates for Spine-Tech Inc, a maker of medical products, after the company reported its second quarter earnings and received FDA approval of its BAK lumbar fusion implants.</p>
<p>-- raised his 1997 earnings estimate to $0.91 a share from $0.60 and 1998 to $1.35 a share from $1.00.</p>
<p>-- said Spine-Tech &quot;has excellent momentum and should maintain its competitive edge.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Tuesday, Spine-Tech reported a second quarter profit of $0.25 a share versus a loss of $0.06 a share one year earlier.</p>
</text>
